  "description": "This NuGet package that wraps all major HTTP authentication types (Basic, Bearer, Digest, NTLM, OAuth2, etc.)\n\n\n      How to use in .net app\n\n      var client = new AuthenticatedHttpClient(new HttpAuthConfig\n      {\n      Type = AuthType.Basic,\n      Username = \"admin\",\n      Password = \"1234\"\n      });\n\n      var response = await client.GetAsync(\"https://amitsinha.com\");\n      var content = await response.Content.ReadAsStringAsync();\n      Console.WriteLine(content);",
